<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:28:41 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>美国司法部称，FBI 因秘密录音设备逮捕了沙特 OpenAI 工程师</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/fbi-arrests-saudi-openai-engineer-over-covert-recording-device-doj-says</link><description>当AI成为安全调查员：openai的事件&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/fbi-arrests-saudi-openai-engineer-over-covert-recording-device-doj-says2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:28:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/fbi-arrests-saudi-openai-engineer-over-covert-recording-device-doj-says</guid></item><item><title>元认知：学习科学判断的结构</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/metacognition-learning-the-structure-of-scientific-judgment</link><description>科学发现不仅仅是产生想法或寻找答案的问题。研究人员必须知道何时探索新的可能性，何时遵循系统程序，何时停止并根据新证据重新评估他们的结论。然而，大多数人工智能模型主要是根据科学研究成果（论文、发现和解决方案）进行训练，而不是指导研究人员进行不确定的长期调查的决策过程。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:13:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/metacognition-learning-the-structure-of-scientific-judgment</guid></item><item><title>考古证实维京人比哥伦布早 500 年到达北美</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/vikings-reached-north-america-500-years-before-columbus-archaeology-confirms</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:58:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/vikings-reached-north-america-500-years-before-columbus-archaeology-confirms</guid></item><item><title>阻断蛋白质可以减少有害老化细胞的积累</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/blocking-a-protein-may-reduce-buildup-of-harmful-aging-cells</link><description>由雪松-西奈健康科学大学研究人员领导的研究小组发现了一种蛋白质，它可以隐藏衰老细胞，使其免受人体免疫系统的影响，从而使它们得以生长并导致与年龄相关的健康问题。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/blocking-a-protein-may-reduce-buildup-of-harmful-aging-cells3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:43:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/blocking-a-protein-may-reduce-buildup-of-harmful-aging-cells</guid></item><item><title>基于年龄的测试遗漏了大多数遗传性癌症风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/age-based-testing-misses-most-with-inherited-cancer-risk</link><description>一项新的研究表明，将种系基因检测限制在 50 岁之前诊断出癌症的患者可能会漏掉绝大多数患有遗传性致病变异的患者。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/age-based-testing-misses-most-with-inherited-cancer-risk.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:28:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/age-based-testing-misses-most-with-inherited-cancer-risk</guid></item><item><title>Fyn 激酶：tau 蛋白病和神经退行性疾病的关键机制调节剂和治疗靶点</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/fyn-kinase-a-key-mechanistic-regulator-and-therapeutic-target-in-tauopathy-and-neurodegenerative-diseases</link><description>突触功能障碍和病理性 tau 蛋白在细胞内积聚是阿尔茨海默病 (AD) 和相关 tau 蛋白病的共同标志，但将这些事件与广泛的神经退行性病变联系起来的分子机制仍不完全清楚。 Src 家族激酶 Fyn 已成为一个关键的信号传导中枢，它将上游致病触发因素（如淀粉样蛋白-β (Aβ)）与下游神经毒性级联反应整合在一起。在这里，我们回顾了 Fyn 在协调突触衰竭中的多方面作用，重点介绍了错误定位的 tau 蛋白招募 Fyn 如何促进 N-甲基-D-天冬氨酸受体过度激活和钙失调。我们研究了 Fyn-tau 相互作用的生物物理基础，特别是液-液相分离在稳定有毒信号复合物中的作用。我们还讨论了小胶质细胞和星形胶质细胞中异常的 Fyn 信号如何放大神经炎症。最后，我们评估了 Fyn 作为治疗靶点的潜力，强调了选择性地将病理信号与生理功能分离以有效阻止疾病进展的策略的必要性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/fyn-kinase-a-key-mechanistic-regulator-and-therapeutic-target-in-tauopathy-and-neurodegenerative-diseases2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:13:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/fyn-kinase-a-key-mechanistic-regulator-and-therapeutic-target-in-tauopathy-and-neurodegenerative-diseases</guid></item><item><title>冠心病且血压低于目标的患者的患病率和特征：INTERASPIRE 研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/prevalence-and-characteristics-of-patients-with-coronary-heart-disease-and-blood-pressure-below-target-the-interaspire-study</link><description>背景&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/prevalence-and-characteristics-of-patients-with-coronary-heart-disease-and-blood-pressure-below-target-the-interaspire-study2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:58:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/prevalence-and-characteristics-of-patients-with-coronary-heart-disease-and-blood-pressure-below-target-the-interaspire-study</guid></item><item><title>私募股权悄然收购 YouTube 重塑在线媒体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/private-equitys-quiet-takeover-of-youtube-reshapes-online-media</link><description>随着成功的 YouTube 频道不仅是数字内容渠道，而且是精益媒体业务，新的数字资产类别在全球和本地出现。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/private-equitys-quiet-takeover-of-youtube-reshapes-online-media.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:43:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/private-equitys-quiet-takeover-of-youtube-reshapes-online-media</guid></item><item><title>纳米颗粒注射重新编程 NK 免疫细胞以对抗癌症和自身免疫性疾病</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nanoparticle-injection-reprograms-nk-immune-cells-to-fight-cancer-and-autoimmune-disorders</link><description>麻省理工学院的工程师开发了一种新方法，可以对自然杀伤 (NK) 免疫细胞进行编程，以靶向癌性 T 细胞或具有自身反应性的 T 细胞，从而导致淋巴瘤和自身免疫性肝炎等疾病。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nanoparticle-injection-reprograms-nk-immune-cells-to-fight-cancer-and-autoimmune-disorders.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:28:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nanoparticle-injection-reprograms-nk-immune-cells-to-fight-cancer-and-autoimmune-disorders</guid></item><item><title>FODMAP 靶向酶组合可改善 IBS 症状</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ibs-symptoms-improved-by-fodmap-targeting-enzyme-combo</link><description>服用非处方药补充剂的参与者在 4 周内症状明显改善，但仍需要随机试验。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ibs-symptoms-improved-by-fodmap-targeting-enzyme-combo.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:13:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ibs-symptoms-improved-by-fodmap-targeting-enzyme-combo</guid></item></channel></rss>